{
  "version": 1,
  "id": "harbor",
  "name": "Harbor",
  "intro": [
    "The harbor. Everything here is in a box, and nobody asks what."
  ],
  "uses": [
    {
      "id": "fish",
      "name": "FISH SELLER",
      "label": "[E] BUY FISH",
      "purchase": "harbor.fish",
      "routes": [
        {
          "when": {
            "state": "harbor.fish.cursor",
            "is": 0
          },
          "command": "harbor.fish.0",
          "pages": [
            "One mackerel. Caught this morning, by me, with a hook, like an animal.",
            "Wrapped in yesterday's Registry notice. Only thing they're good for."
          ],
          "failure": [
            "One token a fish. You have the look of someone with no tokens and strong opinions.",
            "Come back richer. The fish will still be here. Less fresh, but here."
          ]
        },
        {
          "when": {
            "state": "harbor.fish.cursor",
            "is": 1
          },
          "command": "harbor.fish.1",
          "pages": [
            "Sardines. Small, honest, and nobody has put a chip in one yet."
          ],
          "failure": [
            "One token a fish. You have the look of someone with no tokens and strong opinions.",
            "Come back richer. The fish will still be here. Less fresh, but here."
          ]
        },
        {
          "command": "harbor.fish.2",
          "pages": [
            "Another? The cat on the bollard will love you. The cat loves anyone holding a fish."
          ],
          "failure": [
            "One token a fish. You have the look of someone with no tokens and strong opinions.",
            "Come back richer. The fish will still be here. Less fresh, but here."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "drink",
      "name": "TEA CART",
      "label": "[E] HOT DRINK",
      "purchase": "harbor.tea",
      "routes": [
        {
          "when": {
            "weather": [
              "rain",
              "storm"
            ]
          },
          "command": "harbor.tea.wet",
          "pages": [
            "Rain's in. Same price. The rain is free, I checked.",
            "(Tea, hot, with a lid. The lid is the luxury.)"
          ],
          "failure": [
            "One token. Warmth is extra and I don't sell it."
          ]
        },
        {
          "when": {
            "state": "harbor.tea.cursor",
            "is": 0
          },
          "command": "harbor.tea.0",
          "pages": [
            "Tea. Black, because milk needs a permit.",
            "If you're not drinking it, take it to the crane. The operator hasn't come down since Tuesday."
          ],
          "failure": [
            "One token. Warmth is extra and I don't sell it."
          ]
        },
        {
          "when": {
            "state": "harbor.tea.cursor",
            "is": 1
          },
          "command": "harbor.tea.1",
          "pages": [
            "Synth coffee. Tastes like coffee described by someone who once heard about it."
          ],
          "failure": [
            "One token. Warmth is extra and I don't sell it."
          ]
        },
        {
          "command": "harbor.tea.2",
          "pages": [
            "Broth. Don't ask what it was. It was brave."
          ],
          "failure": [
            "One token. Warmth is extra and I don't sell it."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "crane",
      "name": "STS-1 CAB",
      "label": "[E] CRANE CALL BOX",
      "act": "press the call button",
      "routes": [
        {
          "pages": [
            "(The intercom crackles.) STS-1. Unless you're a container, I can't help you.",
            "Unless you've got tea. The cart down the pier does tea. I can't come down: if I come down they make me fill in a form about why."
          ]
        }
      ],
      "items": [
        {
          "item": "tea",
          "label": "hold up the tea",
          "routes": [
            {
              "when": {
                "all": [
                  {
                    "item": "tea",
                    "atLeast": 1
                  },
                  {
                    "state": "harbor.crane.first",
                    "is": true
                  }
                ]
              },
              "command": "harbor.crane.first",
              "pages": [
                "Is that tea? Hold it up. Higher. Right, stand clear.",
                "(Sixty tonnes of spreader come down, very gently, for one paper cup.)",
                "Bless you. Fourteen hours up here. Have a token, don't tell the union.",
                "From up here I see every box on the pier. My mate on STS-2, round at berth 4 in terminal 2, has one on tonight's schedule the yard system can't find. Lifts what the schedule says, that one. Never asks what."
              ],
              "failure": []
            },
            {
              "when": {
                "item": "tea",
                "atLeast": 1
              },
              "command": "harbor.crane.repeat",
              "pages": [
                "Another one? You're spoiling me. (Up goes the cup.)",
                "The patrol boat never looks up, you know. Nobody looks up."
              ],
              "failure": []
            },
            {
              "pages": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "speakerKind": "device"
    },
    {
      "id": "bribe",
      "name": "GUARD",
      "label": "[E] TALK TO THE GUARD",
      "purchase": "harbor.bribe",
      "routes": [
        {
          "when": {
            "flag": "harbor:bribed"
          },
          "pages": [
            "I'm not looking. I'm admiring the water. Very busy water tonight."
          ]
        },
        {
          "when": {
            "state": "harbor.bribe.asked",
            "is": false
          },
          "command": "harbor.bribe.ask",
          "pages": [
            "Bonded store. Sealed cargo. Nothing to see.",
            "Not seeing anything costs three tokens."
          ]
        },
        {
          "command": "harbor.bribe.pay",
          "pages": [
            "(He pockets the tokens without looking at them, which is a skill.)",
            "I'm going to have a smoke and look at the sea for exactly as long as it takes. Go on."
          ],
          "failure": [
            "Three. I can count, even if the Registry won't let me vote."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "mark",
      "name": "GUARD",
      "label": "[E] LOOK AT THE MARK",
      "routes": [
        {
          "when": {
            "flag": "harbor:bribed"
          },
          "command": "harbor.mark",
          "speaker": "PAINTED MARK",
          "pages": [
            "A lantern, painted by hand in whitewash over the company logo. The paint is still tacky.",
            "Under it, in pencil: COUNTED OUT? THE CANALS, UNDER THE THIRD BRIDGE. ASK FOR A LANTERN."
          ]
        },
        {
          "pages": [
            "Oi. Bonded store. Step back from the seals."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cat",
      "name": "DOCK CAT",
      "label": "[E] THE CAT",
      "act": "look at the cat",
      "routes": [
        {
          "when": {
            "item": "fish",
            "atLeast": 1
          },
          "pages": [
            "(The cat looks at the fish in your hand, then at you. It waits for you to work it out.)"
          ]
        },
        {
          "pages": [
            "(The cat looks at your empty hands, then at the fish stand, then back at you. The message is clear.)"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "items": [
        {
          "item": "fish",
          "label": "give it the fish",
          "routes": [
            {
              "when": {
                "item": "fish",
                "atLeast": 1
              },
              "command": "harbor.cat.feed",
              "pages": [
                "(You put the fish down. The cat inspects it like a customs officer, then eats it like a smuggler.)",
                "(It lets you scratch one ear, once. That's the deal.)"
              ],
              "failure": []
            },
            {
              "pages": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
